<< /Subtype /application#2Fx-tex/Type /EmbeddedFile /Params<</ModDate (D:20261114) >> /Length 133 >>        
stream
\begin {equation*}q(p^{-1}(U)) \text { is open in } X/\sim \text { if and only if } p^{-1}(U) \text { is open in } X.\end {equation*}
endstream
endobj
16229 0 obj
<< /Type /Filespec /AFRelationship /Source /Desc (TeX source) /F (tag-AFfile2864.tex) /UF <FEFF007400610067002D0041004600660069006C00650032003800360034002E007400650078> /EF<</F 16228 0 R/UF 16228 0 R>> >>
